WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:15.530
Kep woke up.

2
00:00:15.531 --> 00:00:23.211
"What's going on?" he said.

3
00:00:23.212 --> 00:00:28.335
The bunnies ran toward the tree.

4
00:00:28.336 --> 00:00:30.738
"Help!" Peter cried.

5
00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:33.302
"The fox!"

6
00:00:33.303 --> 00:00:37.533
The lambs saw the fox. "Baa!"

7
00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:48.815
They ran away.

8
00:00:48.816 --> 00:00:50.268
Then . . .

9
00:00:50.269 --> 00:00:55.558
The fox grabbed Peter's tail!

10
00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:58.599
Kep barked loudly at the fox.

11
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.289
"Go away, Fox!

12
00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:05.342
Leave the lambs and bunnies alone!"

13
00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:08.047
Kep snapped at the fox.

14
00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:11.668
"Ahh!" The fox dropped Peter's tail.

15
00:01:11.669 --> 00:01:16.832
He ran away.

16
00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:22.278
Peter and Benjamin cheered.

17
00:01:22.279 --> 00:01:25.473
"We saved the lamb!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:25.474 --> 00:01:28.687
"Kep saved us!" Peter said.

19
00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.979
Kep looked down.

20
00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.713
"I fell asleep.

21
00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:38.018
That was a big mistake."

22
00:01:38.019 --> 00:01:40.633
Benjamin smiled at Kep.

23
00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:43.073
"We will play here now.

24
00:01:43.074 --> 00:01:45.569
What about Ring Around the Rosy?"

25
00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:50.188
"Baa!" said the lambs happily.

26
00:01:50.189 --> 00:01:52.659
Peter rubbed his tail.

27
00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:55.425
"I have a better idea.

28
00:01:55.426 --> 00:02:10.491
Let's play Ring Around Kep!"
